---
import {coreArticles} from '../lib/core-articles';
import type {Entry,Language} from '../lib/content';
interface Props {lang:Language;all:Entry[];}
const {lang,all}=Astro.props;
const items=coreArticles(lang,all);
---
{items.length>0&&<section class="core-articles" aria-labelledby="core-articles-heading">
  <h2 id="core-articles-heading">{lang==='ko'?'코드로 확인하는 기술 가이드':'Practical Guides with Code'}</h2>
  <p>{lang==='ko'?'셸 입력 검증부터 Java·Spring 실행 예제까지, 해결하려는 문제에서 시작하세요. 각 글에서 재현 환경과 확인 범위를 설명합니다.':'Start with the problem you need to solve, from shell input checks to Java and Spring examples. Each guide records its reproduction environment and limits.'}</p>
  <ol>{items.map(entry=><li><a href={entry.url}>{entry.title}</a></li>)}</ol>
</section>}
<style>
.core-articles{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:32px;margin-bottom:40px}
h2{font-size:24px;line-height:1.5}p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}
ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px 36px;padding-left:24px;margin-top:24px}
li{padding-left:4px;line-height:1.7;overflow-wrap:anywhere}a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:800px){ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
